.TH CRUNCH_WAITID 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
crunch_waitid \- Linux x86-64 syscall 247
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/syscall_220_259.h>
.B int crunch_waitid(int type, pid_t id, siginfo_t* information, int options, struct rusage* usage);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Invokes the five-argument Linux waitid syscall, including its optional resource usage output.
This is a direct Linux x86-64 syscall wrapper; availability and permissions depend on the kernel and security policy.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set on failure.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR waitid (2)
